1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,867
Yet the sal does three times that, in silence, all day long.

2
00:00:03,867 --> 00:00:04,622
How?

3
00:00:04,622 --> 00:00:11,484
By the end of this lesson you will know, and the answer is a surprise: the water is not pushed up from below.

4
00:00:11,484 --> 00:00:13,007
It is pulled from above.

